  "description": "Segment Any Change (AnyChange) is a zero-shot change detection model for remote sensing, built on the Segment Anything Model (SAM) via a training-free adaptation method called bitemporal latent matching. It enables zero-shot prediction and generalization on unseen change types and data distributions, supporting instance-level and pixel-level change masks in fully automatic, semi-automatic, and interactive modes.",
